    "gaps": [
      "Scope is checked against complete native sorted discovery; the 1024-case bound is an adapter domain restriction, not a native CLI cap. A nonempty traversal advances one item per visit. Exact-bound completion succeeds; exhaustion fails before downstream steps.",
      "Empty traversals use an identity body once to lower native while guards into PRISM bounded loops; no file is read or report visited by that identity.",
      "3600 seconds and 2052 calls are normalization limits; native main and the hub do not impose a subprocess timeout. Lunar supplies receipts and digests; native counts are emitted on the MCP diagnostic channel.",
      "Unhandled errors stop immediately; earlier report or JSON writes remain. No rollback, retry, checkpoint, compilation or scientific promotion is added.",
      "This projection executes the selected main payload with fixed --update-consistency flags. Service mutation and mount authorization run before discovery; hub preflight/dry-run/subprocess/write-audit transport remains controller-owned."
    ]
  },
